{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_915.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"9f833aeb0a992dedd2c23868985161da9d1b6c4c952ff062f77587c37db67d02","ja":"真美と雪歩の自由研究","zh":"真美与雪步的自由研究","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_915.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"d028267ebdf5de1d171690545d86a2e15b4f5f320b01ef6bc42019e60e7e5fb6","ja":"『綺麗の秘訣は、ナイトルーティンにあり！』か……。\n私も、こういうのやった方がいいのかなぁ……？","zh":"“美丽的秘诀，就在于夜间习惯！”吗……\n我是不是也该做做这种事呢……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_915.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"cafafcdef65294ee57b688dc6ca2141ece1bd9651b0d504c1b4ac116edffcd3d","ja":"ゆきぴょん、お待たせ～。着替え終わったよ～♪\nあれ、なに読んでんの？　もしかして、ムフフな雑誌？","zh":"雪步，久等啦～我换好衣服啦～♪  \n咦，你在看什么呢？该不会是什么嘿嘿嘿的杂志吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_915.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"55abca193e71a9c0a9c05d10f4e7d81d311e3a4178d4b9fecc41a7d0470435e1","ja":"ち、違うよ、真美ちゃん！　最新の女性誌だよ！\nさっき莉緒さんが貸してくれたんだ。","zh":"不、不是的，真美！这是最新的女性杂志！\n刚才莉绪姐借给我的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_915.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d492f792d773396c500f704b7ef195a7a2590b480cc8b27a3ce00a656ee4bad0","ja":"……コレはっ！\n最近バズりまくりと噂のファッション誌だね！","zh":"……这就是！\n听说是最近特别火的时尚杂志！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_915.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"8a2a41cf579b9f1f5f463781f8da08395fb18ab2fc7225f10e223d1bdbf4e624","ja":"さすが、りおっち。トレンドを逃しませんな～。","zh":"不愧是莉绪，总是紧跟潮流呢～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_915.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"7a690c4663fc60a0f1db36e6b5034221d0d425c1525431126a0158a624a28f44","ja":"そうだね。はぁ～……雑誌のモデルさん達、\nみんなカッコよくてオトナで……憧れちゃうなぁ。","zh":"没错。唉～……杂志上的模特们，\n个个都帅气又成熟……真让人羡慕啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_915.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"19e23150b1c732a6597f0de82e2cc6be640fc07c4c213ab73884977d4bb3091e","ja":"どれどれ……ホントだ～。でもさ、オトナって、\n寝る前に何かしないといけないの？","zh":"看看……真的耶～不过，成年人睡觉前必须做点什么吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_915.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"4842c113d7a51a83d53136da83633bdd5621f96b320a9c94463b0062cde1fc1b","ja":"そうじゃないと思うけど……。こういうのマネしたら、\n私も少しはオトナっぽくなれるかなぁ、なんて……。","zh":"我觉得应该不是这样……不过，要是模仿这种风格，我是不是也能稍微变得成熟一点呢……之类的……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_915.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"1054853e49dcce91f039cd619968a107686917ed63c6e90099206566ac31ec0d","ja":"そう言われたら、真美も気になってきたかも……。\nねえねえ。キレイのヒケツ、ケンキューしてみない？","zh":"你这么一说，真美也开始有点在意了……。\n呐呐，要不要也来研究一下保持美丽的秘诀？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_915.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"61a4dcb3f56a2c2d0d68dacd948f439e53426a100f0a6a9857822420d38b7294","ja":"研究？　たしかに、みんながどんなことしてるかとか、\nちょっと興味あるけど……。","zh":"研究？确实有点想知道大家都在做些什么……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_915.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"d7b9335c2ea55526d038141304713370e6ee13edce3b742be959bb29f56487b1","ja":"んじゃ決～まり♪　……あっ、琴葉お姉ちゃん発見！\nいくぞ、ゆきぴょん隊員！　トツゲーキッ！！","zh":"那就决定啦♪……啊，发现琴叶姐姐了！\n出发吧，雪步队员！突击——！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_915.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"62d996644d2f114cc9016b3e068be519bc76aa755debf83432921967ce62d09a","ja":"へっ！？　隊員ってなに！？\nよ、よくわからないけど……待って、真美ちゃん～！","zh":"诶！？队员是什么意思！？\n我、我不太明白……等等，真美～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
